{"root":{"data":{"id":"djtba9lw9nk0","created":1783526235819,"text":"数据存储","priority":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbbk1h3s0","created":1783526318425,"text":"目前架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":62.83333256261187,"y":-143.16666099015225}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbbute5o80","created":1783526360349,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerController"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbcnhjnfk0","created":1783526422759,"text":"痛点：PlayerController负责的内容太多太杂，负责RPC大量函数的转接，会有很多的代码干扰，我认为PlayerController应该当作中转站，影响判断，模块化有助于项目的理解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbjnstcu80","created":1783526971990,"text":"痛点2：个体获取的数据应该共用一块内存，避免各自从云端复制一块独立的内存下来。因此需缓存数据并封装数据获取接口，而在playerController里封装则会导致单个代码文件过大且由于功能多样，容易混淆"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djtbd60e7w00","created":1783526463081,"text":"优化后的架构","layout_mind_offset":{"x":619.8333005574029,"y":45.833330220646644}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djtbdckxvc80","created":1783526477384,"text":"服务器数据->PlayerPropertyComponent缓存->个体使用","layout_right_offset":{"x":589.9999824166302,"y":-13.749999590218067}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djtbirn92qw0","created":1783526901997,"text":"优点：PlayerPropertyComponent只负责数据存储这单一责职","layout_right_offset":{"x":589.9999824166302,"y":-13.749999590218067}},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}